                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "filter",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Filter expression syntax.\n\nSupported fields: `status`, `metric_id`, `metric_name`, `value`, `create_time`, `start_time`, `end_time`\n\nOperators: `=`, `!=`, `>`, `<`, `>=`, `<=`, `AND`, `OR`\n\nValues may be unquoted or double-quoted. Values containing spaces must be quoted (e.g., `status=\"IN PROGRESS\"`).\n"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "page_size",
                  "value": "50",
                  "description": "Maximum number of results per page"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "page_token",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Opaque pagination token from previous response"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "order_by",
                  "value": "metric_name",
                  "description": "Sort order specification.\n\nFormat: `field` or `-field` (descending)\n\nSupported fields: `metric_name`, `create_time`, `value`, `start_time`, `end_time`\n"
                }
